# Postfix header_checks — discard high-score spam before delivery
#
# X-Spam-Level uses one asterisk per integer point of SpamAssassin score.
# Alert-flood emails score ~4-5 (tagged only, still delivered).
# Drug spam emails score ~14 (matched here, silently discarded).
#
# Match 8 or more asterisks = score >= 8 → DISCARD
/^X-Spam-Level: \*{8}/     DISCARD spam score exceeds discard threshold
